00:19:28.210 --> 00:19:28.610
What money?

00:19:29.030 --> 00:19:29.830
The money from the hotel.

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:31.060
You guys, we gotta go.

00:19:31.320 --> 00:19:31.900
The hotel.

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:33.040
I didn't take any money.

00:19:33.200 --> 00:19:34.440
I found it in your dresser drawer.

00:19:35.510 --> 00:19:36.530
Why did you take it?

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:37.280
What?

00:19:37.640 --> 00:19:38.680
These were family.

00:19:38.980 --> 00:19:39.920
We could have helped you.

00:19:40.510 --> 00:19:41.410
Justin, this is crazy.

00:19:41.550 --> 00:19:42.170
This is a mistake.

00:19:42.350 --> 00:19:42.850
I didn't do it.

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:44.310
Lace, I don't know what to tell you.

00:19:44.690 --> 00:19:46.310
You're not actually believing this, are you?

00:19:46.570 --> 00:19:48.330
Look, maybe we can sort this out later.

00:19:48.390 --> 00:19:48.850
Sort this out?

00:19:48.910 --> 00:19:49.770
There's nothing to sort out.

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:50.630
I didn't do anything.

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:53.170
Look, we'll be in Australia for two weeks.

00:19:53.310 --> 00:19:55.370
We'll discuss your status when we get back.

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:56.310
I'm not going?

00:19:56.530 --> 00:19:59.090
But I'm part of this team.

00:19:59.370 --> 00:19:59.970
Well, you...

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:01.500
been temporarily replaced.

00:20:02.044 --> 00:20:04.044
The place? By who?

00:20:07.676 --> 00:20:09.636
No. Oh, no. Not her.

00:20:10.556 --> 00:20:12.556
You set me up, you bitch!

00:20:13.500 --> 00:20:14.340
Come on, you guys!

00:20:14.588 --> 00:20:15.968
What do you want us to do?

00:20:16.108 --> 00:20:17.268
You messed up, please.

00:20:17.448 --> 00:20:18.368
Bert, please.

00:20:19.228 --> 00:20:20.128
I'm so sorry.

00:20:20.764 --> 00:20:23.204
You guys don't leave me.

00:20:23.344 --> 00:20:23.804
No, come on.

00:20:25.020 --> 00:20:26.320
You guys, you can't just leave.
